  "about": "Fill recipes for assisted apply (CLAUDE.md section 7). Each system is DATA: URL patterns, ordered CSS selectors per profile key, the continue/next buttons (shown as a hint, never clicked), the submit buttons (HIGHLIGHTED for the person, never clicked), the application-received markers, and notes. Served at GET /api/autofill/recipes and embedded in extension/autofill_core.js as the offline fallback copy (scripts/embed_recipes.py keeps them in sync). Verified by fetching each system's live public page with curl on the date in each entry's 'verified' block; where a system renders its form only with JavaScript the raw HTML is recorded as seen and selectors come from the vendor's own shipped bundle or documented attributes, never guessed.",
